# Layout 1 — Metadata rail (GitHub-issue style)

Main column = fields + annotations. Right rail = Labels / Connected / Versions, always visible.

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Tools / Hammer drill  [v3 Draft]                         [Publish] [Edit] [⋮]  │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────┤
│                                                         │ Labels               │
│  Details                                                │  ◉ equipment (inh.)  │
│  ────────────────────────────────────────────           │  ◉ heavy ◉ rental    │
│  Name          Hammer drill                             │  [+ add]             │
│  Power         1100 W                                   ├──────────────────────┤
│  Weight        2.9 kg                                   │ Connected            │
│  Description   Long text gets full width here           │  → kit of            │
│                instead of a cramped half column…        │    • Site kit A      │
│                                                         │  ← stored in         │
│  ┌ Notes ── Tasks ── Activity ─────────────────────┐    │    • Depot 7 [v2]    │
│  │                                                 │    │  [+ connect]        │
│  │  ▸ "Check chuck wear" — Kalle, 2d               │    ├──────────────────────┤
│  │  ▸ ☐ Order spare batteries (due Fri)            │    │ Versions             │
│  │  ▸ v2 published by Anna                         │    │  ● v3 Draft          │
│  │                                                 │    │  ○ v2 Latest         │
│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘    │  ○ v1                │
│                                                         │  [New version]       │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────┘
```

**Pros:** fields get real width; all metadata glanceable; familiar pattern.
**Cons:** rail cramps long relation lists; versions compete w/ labels for rail space.
**Best when:** field values are the main read; relations/versions are secondary.
